<!-- MOI CHUOI O DAY PHAI CO DAU TIENG VIET DAY DU.

    Khac han quy uoc cua phan ma nguon: chu thich trong code viet khong
    dau la lua chon ve kieu code, khong sao. Nhung file nay thi khac -
    day la nhung cau se duoc DOC LEN THANH TIENG, hoac duoc TalkBack doc.

    Bo doc tieng Viet doc "Dang chay" thanh mot chuoi am vo nghia, khong
    phai "dang chay" - vi khong co dau thi khong xac dinh duoc thanh
    dieu. Bo dau o day la lam hong dung thu nguoi dung nhan duoc.

    ================================================================
    VA BON QUY TAC O muc 4.4 CUA THIET KE
    ================================================================

    1. Khong chuoi nao chua ten benh
    2. Khong cau nao khang dinh ve tinh trang nguoi dung
    3. Khong con so nao duoc goi la diem so hay muc do
    4. Khong cau nao hua hen hieu qua dieu tri

    Ben Python co `tests/loi_chung/test_cau_chu.py` quet tu dong cac
    chuoi trong ma nguon. File nay KHONG duoc bo test do quet, nen bon
    quy tac tren nam o day duoi dang mot dong chu - va o mat nguoi review.

    Luu y ve so: dung dau PHAY thap phan trong cau noi ("0,05") vi do la
    cach doc tieng Viet. Rieng o NHAP LIEU thi van la dau cham, vi do la
    dinh dang may doc. -->
